  "finish": { "grain": 0, "vignette": 0, "glow": true, "paperGrain": true, "warmVignette": 0.35 },
  "banned": [
    "a lot of text: words only when the word is the point, a few at a time, hand-lettered",
    "plain vector shapes with even, still outlines ('2000s Flash'); gradients or digital glows inside the paint",
    "any 3D rotation or projection",
    "pure black or pure white",
    "faces that snap between expressions; linear or constant-speed moves; every part moving at once; mirrored limbs",
    "a tiny character for the whole film; a character standing still with nothing happening",
    "hard starts, hard ends and hard cuts everywhere; events stacked with no holds",
    "jittery re-boiling of things that should hold; muddy green-grey glows (yellow painted over blue)",
    "Anthropic's mascot or any existing character: the character here is invented"
  ],
